        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-09T06:10:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/users/j1hopki1\" title=\"View user profile.\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">j1hopki1</a>&nbsp;just put up some narative games like this, but I don't think that there is a 'Living Campaign' side to it - he's just writting story challenges.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But that got me thinking about this one again, so Im here to bump this thread, and probably tomorrow or monday im going to post a Living campaign idea - A challenge with a specific set of heroes and villains and story, and a set of requirements to make note of in the game - like who got incapd and did the kraken show up? that will influence the next game.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>and of course like this thread suggested, we can pass off the 'Storytellers'</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
