        "created_at": "2013-06-09T17:33:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I've been working on it for a while and have&nbsp;actually already written the full&nbsp;storyline and planned out all the battles. You guys should check it out. Feel free to use any of my ideas, but if you want to do a community story I'd prefer if they were kept separate threads. I do love this idea, though. I'll be sure to contribute here if that's okay.</p>",
