        "created_at": "2013-06-09T18:31:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can't wait. My only suggestions is to start a new thread that has all of the stories in it, as well as posting it in here. All responses, results, discussion, etc. will happen here, while the other thread will only have the actual narrative and game setups (no discussion allowed). This will make it easier to find the newest part and for new-comers to find everything without digging through this thread.</p>",
