        "created_at": "2013-06-10T02:41:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>WOW! Great job! I like how you said what effect each condition will have, but I am debating if I would have preferred to be surprised. Maybe do it this way the first few time, then take it away.</p><p>Also, I think this would be a good thread to post non-official results, then only post one of your games in the other thread.</p><p>EDIT: Quick question, does it matter how the villain wins? Incapping all heroes of pulling the moon into the Earth, which I am assuming will only destroy the city. What about incapping the heroes before or after he flips, thus possibly destroying the device.</p>",
