        "created_at": "2013-06-10T02:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>It's Mad Bomber Blade, so the only way hereos can lose is being Incapped.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Thanks. I was double checking that right now, and I realized the same thing. Oh well, the flip question still counts right?</p>\n<p>Here is a link to the card in case somebody doesn't have it:</p>\n<p>Front:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/image/1444328/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-vengeful-baron-blade-v\">http://boardgamegeek.com/image/1444328/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-vengeful-baron-blade-v</a></p>\n<p>Back:</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://boardgamegeek.com/image/1444327/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-vengeful-baron-blade-v\">http://boardgamegeek.com/image/1444327/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-vengeful-baron-blade-v</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, are the heroes listed in turn order?</p>",
