        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-12T04:56:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since I decided to leave it to one game submission per person, I decided to let the people know what they will be getting into - that way if they want to submit a game for a specific response, they at least have some of it - Ie if they really want Young Legacy this time, theyll keep playing till they get a game with Next evolution out.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But you notice I didnt say what the Blade Batallions getting played (and destroyed of course right away) would mean ... &lt;grins&gt;</p>",
